  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of coastal North Shore’s most beloved suburbs, this solid brick property has stood the test of time and is now ripe for renovation. It presents an unbeatable opportunity for DIY enthusiasts, builders or anyone looking for their next project.\r\n\r\nSet over 2 levels, the upper level enjoys 2 bedrooms, an open plan lounge, dining and kitchen along with a family bathroom and separate toilet. From the living area there is a small deck which offers coastal sea views.\r\n\r\nOn the lower level is a large rumpus which could be used as a second living area or third bedroom. The extra-large laundry may offer possibilities, with council consent, to add an extra bathroom.\r\n\r\nThere is a garage with internal access.\r\n\r\nThe location couldn’t be better with great proximity to Castor Bay beach, local parks and Pupuke golf course. School zones include Campbells Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Westlake Boys’ & Girls’ High Schools.\r\n\r\nIn an area where 'entry level' properties are becoming rare, this is a 'value-add' prospect you cannot afford to miss.\r\n\r\nJoin us at our open homes or call for a private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
